<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's BNDT bank distributes dividends.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's BNDT bank distributes dividends.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Banque Nationale de Developpement Touristique (BNDT) said it will start on Tuesday distributing a 0.5 dinar dividend per share for its 1996 results, unchanged from its level in 1995.</p>
<p>The bank had 6.34 million dinars post tax profits for 1996, down from 8.80 million dinars in 1995, final results showed.</p>
<p>The state-controlled bank is specialised in loans for the tourism sector. It has capital of 30 million dinars. ($=1.1060 dinar)</p>
</text>
